# Classifier-gated cell (2026-10-07, docs/classifier_triage_plan_20261004.md
# stage 2): the IEEE-14 pipeline under classifier_gated_diagnostics, where the
# triage GNN the source tree carries (psse_env/oracle/models/
# triage_gnn_ieee14_20261004) replaces the balanced screen as the source of the
# phasor suspicion, with the baseline expert as teacher (the ledger variants
# read the screen).  Everything is regenerated: the teacher and the profile
# change, so D0, BC0 and both DAgger rounds are new; corpora, plans, seeds and
# the data contract are those of the 2026-10-01 ranked cell.
# Deploy and submit from Windows:
#   PIPE=/scratch/yx3882/research_full_pipeline_20261007_classifier \
#   SOURCE_CELL=/scratch/yx3882/classifier_triage_20261004 BASE=024ffd5 \
#   BRANCH=codex/classifier-triage-20261004 OVERRIDES=classifier_gated_20261007.env \
#   bash research/hpc/full_pipeline_20260907/deploy_cell_from_windows.sh <commit40>
EXPERT_VARIANT=baseline
EVIDENCE_PROFILE=classifier_gated_diagnostics
HIF_SIGNATURE_MODE=discovered
PREVIOUS_PIPE=
